    skos:related <https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/completions/folding/single-fold> ;
    skos:scopeNote "Renamed from single-fold-4-panel in v1.0 of the Product Model (2026-05-20). The new name matches the corresponding Folding term (`printing/completions/finishing/folding/single-fold`) and the broader Setup Model naming convention where panel-count is intrinsic metadata rather than part of the URI."@en,
        "उत्पाद मॉडल v1.0 (2026-05-20) में single-fold-4-panel से नाम बदला गया। नया नाम संगत फ़ोल्डिंग पद (`printing/completions/finishing/folding/single-fold`) और सेटअप मॉडल नामकरण परंपरा से मेल खाता है, जहाँ पैनल संख्या URI का हिस्सा नहीं बल्कि अंतर्निहित मेटाडेटा है।"@hi,
        "Renomeado de single-fold-4-panel na v1.0 do Modelo de Produto (2026-05-20). O novo nome corresponde ao termo de Dobra (`printing/completions/finishing/folding/single-fold`) e à convenção de nomes dos Modelos de Montagem, em que o número de painéis é metadado intrínseco e não parte da URI."@pt ;
